> [A][ special][ indicator][ instead][ of][ aquarium][ water][ permits][ direct][ measurement][ of][ the][ CO][2][ level][ in][ mg][/][L][.][
][20][-][25][ mg][/][L][ CO][2][ is][ ideal][.][
][Re][place][ the][ indicator][ only][ 3][-][4][ weeks][ =][ lasts][ a][ total][ of][ 9][-][12][ months][.][ Ind][icates][ the][ pH][ value][ (][6][.][4][ -][ 7][.][8][)][ in][ addition][ to][ the][ CO][2][ level][.]

