> In the[ second][ book] of[ the][ Harry][ Potter] Series,[ �][�]The Chamber of Secrets�[�] by J[.][K][.][ Rowling],[ Harry][ Potter] finds out that he can communicate with snakes[ using][ the] Parseltong[ue][ language].
